              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jab 91.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nen, doŋ amiyowu twero me nyono twol ki oton, ki me loyo tek ducu pa lakwor; gin mo pe bitimowu marac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi bed kumeno cwinywu pe obed yom pi man ni, cen guwinyo cikwu; ento cwinywu obed yom, pien nyiŋwu gicoyo i wi polo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
